# AI: below section was generated by an AI
# File-format reference (not a runtime dependency): Cherri, MIT license,
# https://github.com/electrikmilk/cherri/tree/5f556958beca7120c6ccfde506825d8218fc773e
# Clock action: https://www.shortcutactions.com/actions/find-alarms
